### ✅ CORRECTED - Price & Date Filtering URLs (Now Working!)

# Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy

## 💰 PRICE FILTERING URLs (FIXED)

### 1. ✅ CORRECT - Using priceMin parameter (min 10 currency units)
http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/search?priceMin=10&page=1&limit=10

### 2. ✅ ALSO WORKS - Using minPrice parameter (min 10 currency units) 
http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/search?minPrice=10&page=1&limit=10

### 3. Price Range using both parameters
http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/search?priceMin=10&priceMax=50&page=1&limit=10

### 4. Price Range using mixed parameters
http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/search?minPrice=10&maxPrice=50&page=1&limit=10

### 5. Budget medicines using minPrice (under 10)
http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/search?maxPrice=10&sortBy=price&sortOrder=asc&page=1&limit=10

### 6. Premium medicines using priceMin (100+)
http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/search?priceMin=100&sortBy=price&sortOrder=desc&page=1&limit=10

