http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/search?createdDateTo=2024-03-31&page=1&limit=10

### 11. Medicines added in November 2024
http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/search?createdDateFrom=2024-11-01&createdDateTo=2024-11-30&page=1&limit=10

### 12. Recent medicines (last 30 days from Nov 19, 2024)
http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/search?createdDateFrom=2024-10-20&page=1&limit=10

## 💰📅 COMBINED PRICE & DATE URLs

### 13. Budget medicines under 20 added in 2024
http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/search?maxPrice=20&createdDateFrom=2024-01-01&sortBy=createdAt&sortOrder=desc&page=1&limit=10

### 14. Mid-range medicines 20-80 added after May 19, 2024
http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/search?priceMin=20&priceMax=80&createdDateFrom=2024-05-19&sortBy=price&sortOrder=asc&page=1&limit=15

### 15. Expensive medicines 100+ added this month
http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/search?minPrice=100&createdDateFrom=2024-11-01&sortBy=price&sortOrder=desc&page=1&limit=10

### 16. Medicines 15-60 added in Q1 2024 (Jan-Mar)
http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/search?priceMin=15&priceMax=60&createdDateFrom=2024-01-01&createdDateTo=2024-03-31&page=1&limit=12

## 🔍 COMPLEX FILTERING URLs

### 17. Omeprazole medicines 10-50 added in 2024
http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/search?genericName=omeprazole&priceMin=10&priceMax=50&createdDateFrom=2024-01-01&createdDateTo=2024-12-31&sortBy=price&sortOrder=asc&page=1&limit=10

### 18. Vitamin medicines 5-100 added after Oct 1, 2024 with stock 20+
http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/search?name=vitamin&minPrice=5&maxPrice=100&createdDateFrom=2024-10-01&stockMin=20&sortBy=createdAt&sortOrder=desc&page=1&limit=20

### 19. Category filter + Price + Date
http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/search?category=64f8a2b4c3d4e5f6789abcde&priceMin=5&priceMax=100&createdDateFrom=2024-01-01&page=1&limit=10

### 20. Search by name + Price range + Recent date
http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/search?name=aspirin&minPrice=10&maxPrice=30&createdDateFrom=2024-11-01&page=1&limit=10

### 21. All filters combined
http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/search?query=anti&category=64f8a2b4c3d4e5f6789abcde&priceMin=5&priceMax=100&stockMin=10&createdDateFrom=2024-01-01&sortBy=price&sortOrder=asc&page=1&limit=15

## 📋 Parameter Reference (UPDATED)

### Price Parameters (BOTH WORK NOW):
- `priceMin=10` OR `minPrice=10` - Minimum price (inclusive)
- `priceMax=50` OR `maxPrice=50` - Maximum price (inclusive)

### Date Parameters:
- `createdDateFrom=2024-01-01` - Start date (YYYY-MM-DD format)
- `createdDateTo=2024-12-31` - End date (YYYY-MM-DD format)

### Other Useful Parameters:
- `genericName=omeprazole` - Filter by generic name
- `name=aspirin` - Filter by medicine name
- `category=64f8a2b4c3d4e5f6789abcde` - Filter by category ID
- `stockMin=10` - Minimum stock quantity
- `stockMax=500` - Maximum stock quantity
- `sortBy=price` - Sort by: name, genericName, price, stock, createdAt
- `sortOrder=asc` - Sort order: asc, desc
- `page=1` - Page number
- `limit=10` - Items per page

## 🔧 THE FIX

**❌ Before (BROKEN):**
```
http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/search?minPrice=10
```

**✅ After (FIXED):**
Now BOTH parameter names work:
```
http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/search?priceMin=10
http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/search?minPrice=10
```

The controller now supports both `priceMin`/`priceMax` (original) and `minPrice`/`maxPrice` (alternative) parameter names for better compatibility.